<http://data.silknow.org/object/aff01688-2d9c-3dda-8993-39f3bb6f2e93>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Work table, rosewood. Decorated with marquetry of various woods (Tunbridge Ware). The top inlaid with a bird and floral designs on small panels of light wood, cubes arranged in oblong panels. Front decorated with butterflies within mosaic borders, sides similarly decorated. Below top a receptacle with sloping sides within a framework of rosewood pulls out. Shaft has chamfered inlaid angles and rests on a base with curved sides and scrolled feet. Top fitted with small compartments with lids padded and covered with red silk, the receptacle for silks etc. covered with same material."@en , "On loan to Bramall Hall, Stockport."@en , "Work table, rosewood with marquetry, England, 1840-60"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/3a6ada87-16e3-33a2-90bd-b03b0ebd34c6> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/34cce7d8-2e45-34e5-b080-52ec50b6adbc> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Work table, rosewood with marquetry, England, 1840-60"@en , "On loan to Bramall Hall, Stockport."@en , "Work table, rosewood. Decorated with marquetry of various woods (Tunbridge Ware). The top inlaid with a bird and floral designs on small panels of light wood, cubes arranged in oblong panels. Front decorated with butterflies within mosaic borders, sides similarly decorated. Below top a receptacle with sloping sides within a framework of rosewood pulls out. Shaft has chamfered inlaid angles and rests on a base with curved sides and scrolled feet. Top fitted with small compartments with lids padded and covered with red silk, the receptacle for silks etc. covered with same material."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/aff01688-2d9c-3dda-8993-39f3bb6f2e93/dimension/3> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/aff01688-2d9c-3dda-8993-39f3bb6f2e93/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/aff01688-2d9c-3dda-8993-39f3bb6f2e93/dimension/1> ;
        dc:identifier                  "W.31:1, 2-1929" ;
